{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-first-teacher","title":"第一导师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-first-teacher","wordCount":1554,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1717,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章对亚里士多德作出综合评价。&quot;第一导师&quot;，是对亚里士多德崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他以百科全书式的成就、对诸多学科的奠基、影响千年的作用，无愧于人类&quot;第一导师&quot;之称。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越贡献，又客观正视其科学错误与时代局限，以辩证的眼光，认识这位永恒的智慧巨人。</p>\n"}